  "verseCount": 14,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAL 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uthenga: Mawu a Yehova kwa Israeli kudzera mwa Malaki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndamukonda Yakobo, Ndamuda Esau",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova akuti, \"Ine ndakukondani. Koma inu mukufunsa kuti, 'Kodi mwatikonda motani?' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MAL 1:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehova akuti, \"Kodi Esau sanali mʼbale wake wa Yakobo? Komatu Ine ndinakonda Yakobo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "koma ndinamuda Esau, ndipo dziko lake lamapiri ndalisandutsa chipululu ndipo cholowa chake ndasiyira ankhandwe a mʼchipululu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwina Edomu nʼkunena kuti, \"Ngakhale taphwanyidwa, tidzamanganso mʼmabwinja.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MAL 1:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Koma Yehova Wamphamvuzonse akuti, \"Iwo angathe kumanganso, koma Ine ndidzazigwetsanso. Iwo adzatchedwa dziko loyipa, la anthu amene Yehova wayipidwa nawo mpaka muyaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inu mudzaziona zimenezi ndi maso anu ndipo mudzati, 'Yehova ndi Wamkulu, ukulu wake umafika ngakhale kunja kwa malire a Israeli!'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nsembe Zosayenera",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Mwana amalemekeza abambo ake, ndipo wantchito amaopa abwana ake. Ngati Ine ndine abambo anu, ulemu wanga uli kuti? Ngati ndine mbuye wanu, nanga kundiopa kuli kuti?\" Akutero Yehova Wamphamvuzonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MAL 1:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Ndinu, inu ansembe, amene mumanyoza dzina langa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MAL 1:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Komatu mukufunsa kuti, 'Kodi timanyoza dzina lanu bwanji?'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Inu mwanyoza dzina langa popereka chakudya chodetsedwa pa guwa langa lansembe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MAL 1:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Komatu mukufunsa kuti, 'Kodi ife takunyozani bwanji?'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MAL 1:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Mwandinyoza ponena kuti tebulo la Yehova ndi lonyozeka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukamapereka nsembe nyama zosaona, kodi sicholakwa? Mukamapereka nsembe nyama zachilema kapena zodwala, kodi sicholakwa? Kayeseni kuzipereka kwa bwanamkubwa wanu! Kodi akasangalatsidwa nanu? Kodi akazilandira? Akutero Yehova Wamphamvuzonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Tsopano tayesani kupempha Mulungu kuti akuchitireni chifundo. Kodi ndi zopereka zotere mʼmanja mwanu, Iye angakulandireni?\" Akutero Yehova Wamphamvuzonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Ndikulakalaka mmodzi wa inu akanatseka zitseko za Nyumba ya Mulungu, kuti musayatsemo moto pachabe pa guwa langa lansembe! Ine sindikukondwera nanu,\" akutero Yehova Wamphamvuzonse, \"ndipo Ine sindidzalandira zopereka za mʼmanja mwanu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dzina langa lidzalemekezedwa pakati pa mitundu ya anthu, kuchokera kummawa mpaka kumadzulo. Mʼmalo monse adzapereka nsembe zofukiza ndi zopereka zangwiro mʼdzina langa, chifukwa dzina langa lidzakhala lalikulu pakati pa mitundu ya anthu,\" akutero Yehova Wamphamvuzonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Koma inu mumalinyoza ponena kuti tebulo la Ambuye, 'ndi lodetsedwa,' ndipo chakudya chake, 'nʼchonyozeka!'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo inu mumati, 'Ndi zotopetsa zimenezi!' Ndipo mumandinyogodola Ine,\" akutero Yehova Wamphamvuzonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MAL 1:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Pamene inu mubweretsa nyama zakuba, zolumala kapena zodwala ndi kupereka nsembe, kodi Ine ndizilandire kuchokera mʼmanja mwanu?\" Akutero Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Atembereredwe munthu wachinyengo amene ali ndi nyama yayimuna yabwino mʼgulu la ziweto zake ndipo analumbira kuyipereka, koma mʼmalo mwake nʼkupereka nsembe kwa Ambuye nyama yosayenera. Yehova Wamphamvuzonse akuti, 'Pakuti ndine mfumu yayikulu, dzina langa liyenera kuopedwa pakati pa anthu a mitundu yonse.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
